{
  "slug": "video-library-classifier",
  "name": "Video Library Classifier",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "A Claude Code / Cowork plugin for videographers who need to organize large libraries of footage before editing in Final Cut Pro.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **3 skills** and **3 commands**.\n\n- **Skills** (3): `classify-video-library` (Clasificación profesional de video con IA (Energía 1-5 descriptiva, Valor Narrativo y FCPXML v1.13)), `convert-audio` (This skill converts audio files to AIFF format for professional editing workflows (Final Cut Pro, Logic Pro, DaVinci…), `fcpxml-from-classification` (Genera un FCPXML listo para importar en Final Cut Pro 11/12.x a partir de un CSV de clasificación…)\n- **Commands** (3): `clasificar-video` (Clasifica una biblioteca de video por tipo de producción (con clasificación visual opcional usando Claude + ffmpeg) y…), `convertir-audio` (Convierte archivos de audio FLAC, M4A, MP3 o WAV a AIFF lossless para editar en Final Cut Pro,…), `generar-fcpxml` (Generates a valid FCPXML 1.13 for Final Cut Pro from a video classification CSV (with Keyword Collections across…)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install video-library-classifier@claude-community` from `felixrivasuxdesigner/video-library-classifier`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
